{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KnnZhsbN1YajaPPj9uBBTh","type":"tool_result","content":"/**\n * Next.js Middleware — Evaluates Vercel Feature Flags server-side.\n * Reads CTA variant flag and sets it in response headers for consumption by Server Components.\n * This ensures zero layout shift and no client-side hydration mismatch.\n */\n\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\nimport { getVariant } from \"@/lib/flags\";\n\n/**\n * Middleware that evaluates A/B test flags for feature flag-controlled pages.\n * Runs before route handlers and Server Components render.\n */\nexport async function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  const response = NextResponse.next();\n\n  // Evaluate the CTA variant for the /book page\n  if (request.nextUrl.pathname.startsWith(\"/book\")) {\n    const variant = await getVariant();\n\n    // Pass variant to Server Components via response header\n    response.headers.set(\"x-variant\", variant);\n\n    // Also set as cookie for client-side tracking (optional)\n    response.cookies.set(\"x-variant\", variant, {\n      httpOnly: false, // Allow client JS to read for GA4 tracking\n      path: \"/\",\n      maxAge: 30 * 24 * 60 * 60, // 30 days\n      sameSite: \"lax\",\n    });\n  }\n\n  return response;\n}\n\nexport const config = {\n  matcher: [\n    /*\n     * Match all request paths except for the ones starting with:\n     * - api (API routes)\n     * - _next/static (static files)\n     * - _next/image (image optimization files)\n     * - favicon.ico (favicon file)\n     * - public (public assets)\n     */\n    \"/((?!api|_next/static|_next/image|favicon.ico|public).*)\",\n  ],\n};\n[rerun: b9]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbfb22f1-8001-4265-ba1a-7ef245a7d994","uuid":"c54c28aa-34df-4f77-b3a1-8649fb6ded6d","timestamp":"2026-04-14T06:29:51.395Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/**\n * Next.js Middleware — Evaluates Vercel Feature Flags server-side.\n * Reads CTA variant flag and sets it in response headers for consumption by Server Components.\n * This ensures zero layout shift and no client-side hydration mismatch.\n */\n\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\nimport { getVariant } from \"@/lib/flags\";\n\n/**\n * Middleware that evaluates A/B test flags for feature flag-controlled pages.\n * Runs before route handlers and Server Components render.\n */\nexport async function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  const response = NextResponse.next();\n\n  // Evaluate the CTA variant for the /book page\n  if (request.nextUrl.pathname.startsWith(\"/book\")) {\n    const variant = await getVariant();\n\n    // Pass variant to Server Components via response header\n    response.headers.set(\"x-variant\", variant);\n\n    // Also set as cookie for client-side tracking (optional)\n    response.cookies.set(\"x-variant\", variant, {\n      httpOnly: false, // Allow client JS to read for GA4 tracking\n      path: \"/\",\n      maxAge: 30 * 24 * 60 * 60, // 30 days\n      sameSite: \"lax\",\n    });\n  }\n\n  return response;\n}\n\nexport const config = {\n  matcher: [\n    /*\n     * Match all request paths except for the ones starting with:\n     * - api (API routes)\n     * - _next/static (static files)\n     * - _next/image (image optimization files)\n     * - favicon.ico (favicon file)\n     * - public (public assets)\n     */\n    \"/((?!api|_next/static|_next/image|favicon.ico|public).*)\",\n  ],\n};","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01DxAxV68LVe7cWW9ixnGqQr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! So the middleware.ts file exists in the HEAD commit and is staged for deletion. I need to understand why it was deleted and then restore it or recreate it.\n\nNow let me check the acceptance criteria again:\n1. ✓ Vercel Edge Config store created and connected to the project (likely already done)\n2. ✓ @vercel/edge-config and @vercel/flags packages installed (already in package.json)\n3. ✓ A/B flag defined for /book page primary CTA copy (already in flags.ts)\n4. ✓ Flag evaluated in Next.js Middleware and variant cookie set before page render (middleware.ts exists in HEAD)\n5. ? GA4 custom dimension records which variant each session received\n6. ? Vercel Flags UI in dashboard shows flag status, rollout percentage, and per-user override capability\n\nThe problem seems to be that:\n1. Middleware.ts is staged for deletion\n2. GA4 tracking might not be fully implemented\n\nLet me check if there's GA4 tracking code in the project already.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":99188,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":619},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbfb22f1-8001-4265-ba1a-7ef245a7d994","uuid":"ad7d324a-2d89-4d32-967f-a84de9d2a2b5"}
