{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_012LVBf7yTwS4UsqvfKPWnux","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! I can see that:\n1. `BookEcommerceTracker.tsx` already has GA4 custom dimension setup for variant tracking\n2. AnalyticsProvider.tsx has gtag setup\n3. The code is already trying to track the variant with `\"dimension_1\": variant`\n\nSo the implementation is mostly complete. The issue is that:\n1. middleware.ts is staged for deletion and needs to be restored or recreated\n2. The variant needs to be properly passed to the component for GA4 tracking\n\nLet me check what BookEcommerceTracker.tsx looks like to see if it's properly reading the variant.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1069,"cache_read_input_tokens":99807,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1069},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbfb22f1-8001-4265-ba1a-7ef245a7d994","uuid":"d0041b84-4c07-49cc-9886-a309ff9cefd3"}
